@startuml seq-resilience
!theme plain

title Payment → Provider: Resilience (CB + Retry Queue + DLQ)

participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Circuit Breaker" as CB
participant "Provider" as Provider
participant "Payment DB" as DB
participant "Kafka Connect" as KC
participant "Kafka" as Kafka

note over CB
  Circuit Breaker:
  - CLOSED: requests go to Provider
  - OPEN: reject immediately (no HTTP)
  - HALF-OPEN: allow 3 probe requests

  Transitions:
  - CLOSED → OPEN: 50% errors in last 10 calls
  - OPEN → HALF-OPEN: after 60s cooldown
  - HALF-OPEN → CLOSED: 3 probes succeed
  - HALF-OPEN → OPEN: any probe fails
end note

note over CB: state: CLOSED

== Phase 1: Sync Retries (one payment, in-memory) ==

Payment -> CB: call
CB -> Provider: POST /payments
Provider --> CB: timeout (30s)
CB --> Payment: error

loop 3 more attempts (backoff 1s, 2s, 4s)
    Payment -> CB: retry
    CB -> Provider: POST /payments
    Provider --> CB: timeout
    CB --> Payment: error
end

note over Payment: All 4 attempts failed for this payment

note over CB
  8/10 errors (this + other payments)
  → CB OPEN
end note

== Phase 2: Fallback to Retry Queue ==

Payment -> DB: status=PROCESSING, retry_count=1
Payment -> DB: INSERT outbox

KC -> DB: poll outbox
KC -> Kafka: PaymentRetryRequested\n→ payments.retry

== Phase 3: Async Retry #1 (after 1m) ==

Payment -> Kafka: poll
Kafka --> Payment: {payment_id}

Payment -> CB: call
note over CB: OPEN → reject without HTTP
CB --> Payment: CircuitBreakerOpenException

Payment -> DB: retry_count=2
Payment -> DB: INSERT outbox
KC -> DB: poll
KC -> Kafka: PaymentRetryRequested

== Phase 4: Async Retry #2 (after 2m) ==

Payment -> Kafka: poll
Kafka --> Payment: {payment_id}

note over CB: 60s passed → HALF-OPEN (allow probes)

Payment -> CB: call
CB -> Provider: POST /payments

alt Provider recovered
    Provider --> CB: 200 OK
    CB --> Payment: success
    note over CB: Probe OK → CLOSED
    Payment -> DB: status=SUCCESS

else Provider still down
    Provider --> CB: timeout
    CB --> Payment: error
    note over CB: Probe failed → OPEN (reset cooldown)
    Payment -> DB: retry_count=3
    Payment -> DB: INSERT outbox
    KC -> Kafka: PaymentRetryRequested
end

== Phase 5: DLQ (after max retries) ==

note over Payment: retry_count > 3 → give up

Payment -> DB: status=FAILED
Payment -> DB: INSERT outbox (PaymentFailed)
KC -> Kafka: PaymentFailed → payments.failed

note over Kafka
  Wallet: release reserve
  Query: update read model
  Notification: notify customer
end note

note right of Kafka: If consumer fails to process\n→ payments.retry.dlq

@enduml
